68
00:03:22,420 --> 00:03:23,490
Oh, I'll get that.

69
00:03:23,490 --> 00:03:25,090
- I got it. I got it. - No, no, it's...

70
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:27,640
Why do you have a history textbook?

71
