"Your invitation must have gotten lost in the matrix."

213
00:09:41,750 --> 00:09:45,030
Good Lord, what have I done?

214
00:09:45,030 --> 00:09:47,220
Good Lord, what have I done?

215
00:09:50,980 --> 00:09:52,320
Terrible.

216
00:09:53,420 --> 00:09:55,960
All right, hotshot, let's hear your Indian.

217
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:57,440
I can't sit on that elephant,

218
