219
00:10:05,160 --> 00:10:06,690
Okay, yeah, that's pretty good.

220
00:10:28,580 --> 00:10:30,550
Please be good.

221
00:10:30,550 --> 00:10:32,550
Please be good.

222
00:10:43,660 --> 00:10:45,060
Okay.

223
00:10:45,560 --> 00:10:47,960
