236
00:11:25,690 --> 00:11:26,590
Play.

237
00:11:26,590 --> 00:11:29,790
Play. Play.

238
00:11:30,980 --> 00:11:32,000
Stephen Hawking...

239
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:35,070
Stephen Hawking... Stephen Hawking.

240
00:11:36,990 --> 00:11:38,570
