244
00:11:45,450 --> 00:11:46,170
I don't know what to do.

245
00:11:46,400 --> 00:11:47,940
I mean, the paper's terrible.

246
00:11:47,940 --> 00:11:49,990
But if I tell her, she'll know that I read it

247
00:11:49,990 --> 00:11:51,430
