267
00:12:31,520 --> 00:12:32,430
Give it a couple more days.

268
00:12:32,430 --> 00:12:35,190
I'm sure he'll play, and you'll see that everything's fine.

269
00:12:35,750 --> 00:12:36,780
My turn.

270
00:12:36,780 --> 00:12:38,740
I can't let Penny hand in a bad paper,

271
00:12:38,740 --> 00:12:40,530
